### 训练模块 API 测试

### ========== 训练模板 ==========

### 获取训练域列表（含模板数量）
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/template/domains
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取所有训练模板列表
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/template/list
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 按训练域获取模板列表
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/template/list?domain=social
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取单个模板详情
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/template/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### ========== 训练会话 ==========

### 创建训练会话
POST {{appApi}}/member/training/session/create
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "childId": 1,
  "templateId": 1,
  "difficultyLevel": 1,
  "environment": {
    "available_rooms": ["客厅", "卧室"],
    "available_materials": ["玩具车", "积木"],
    "time_limit_minutes": 10
  }
}

### 获取今日训练列表
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/session/today-list?childId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取今日训练进度
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/session/today-progress?childId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取会话详情
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/session/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 分页查询会话
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/session/page?childId=1&pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 开始训练会话
PUT {{appApi}}/member/training/session/start?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 跳过训练会话
PUT {{appApi}}/member/training/session/skip?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### ========== 训练日志（打卡） ==========

### 创建打卡记录
POST {{appApi}}/member/training/log/create
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sessionId": 1,
  "completed": true,
  "childMood": 1,
  "successCount": 5,
  "difficulties": ["环境太吵"],
  "parentComment": "孩子今天状态不错",
  "actualDurationMinutes": 8,
  "sharedToCommunity": false
}

### 获取日志详情
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/log/get?id=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 分页查询日志
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/log/page?childId=1&pageNo=1&pageSize=10
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取 AI 训练反馈
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/log/feedback?logId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

### 获取训练统计信息
GET {{appApi}}/member/training/log/statistics?childId=1
Authorization: Bearer {{appToken}}
tenant-id: {{appTenantId}}

